notes: W4 audio. The packets of audio_aac_priming.mov, mp4a v0 + esds, sgpd/sbgp roll -1, ftyp mp42, edits: empty 441 / 44100 s, then 11025 frames from media time 3112 (priming + 1000). AVFoundation and DXVKit Plus decode identical samples (docs/data/w4-crosstest-fixtures.jsonl).
